WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.600
Lugia brought Satoshi and Go together.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.320
They became research fellows
at Kuchiba City's new Sakuragi Institute,

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.450
where they solved the mystery
of the Fushigisou march,

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.990
finding themselves thrilled once again
by the wonders of Pokémon.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:25.710
And today, they greet
another new morning at the Institute.

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.050
Look at this, Go!

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.470
It's a huge discovery!

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.180
A huge discovery?

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.810
You can brush your teeth
really fast if you do this!

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.070
You've got it, Pikachu!

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:52.400
But I can do it faster!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.740
You'll make yourselves
dizzy doing that.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:59.280
I'll be fi-

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.290
Spinning, spinning,
everything's spinning...

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.700
Thanks.

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.450
Morning, Barrierd...

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.750
So dizzy...

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.380
Let's go, Satoshi!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.130
Go?

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.390
Hold on, Go!
What about my breakf-

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:06.930
Director Sakuragi!

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.600
Good morning, everyone.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.150
Hey! This data!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:13.770
It says there's a phenomenon about
Pokémon growing gigantic!

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.780
What?! That sounds cool!

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.660
Now, now, calm down.
That's a phenomenon seen in the Galar Region.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:23.490
The Galar Region?

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:26.160
Director Sakuragi!
I wanna go there!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.040
Me, too!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.460
Very well...
It's a great opportunity.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:33.670
You can see Pokémon gigantification
with your very own eyes.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.750
Go and etch the experience
into your minds and bodies.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.420
All right!

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:39.630
Just you wait, Galar Region!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.540
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:55.120
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.830
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:00.710
And skip the slow send-off

00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:03.050
Be it through fire or through water

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.720
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:10.220
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:15.480
Each and every one of my memories

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:20.060
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.980
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:29.740
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:36.750
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:40.970
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:42.290
Let's have a fight!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:45.010
1: Once the battle's done

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:46.840
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:51.180
On 3, let's be friends!

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:57.850
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:03:57.850 --> 00:04:03.190
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.690
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:09.820
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.490
I choose you!

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:20.500
A Meeting With Hibunny!!
Let's Go to the Galar Region!

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.040
There it is!
The Galar Region!

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.290
Where? Where?

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:40.900
Shoot City, Galar Region

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.450
Hmm... From here, we should...

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.830
Go! Which way now?

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.750
We need to change
onto the Wild Area train.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.540
The ticket counter is...
that way!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:19.670
All right!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.670
I said, <i>it's that way</i>!

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:26.880
What? The next train
leaves in three hours?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.970
Um... Are there any
other ways to get there?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.470
There is a bus...

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.890
But the next one's in six hours.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.270
Seriously...?

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.900
Well, nothing we can do.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.690
So how about we
go find something to eat?

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.110
I'm in!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.530
Let's see, what's nearby...

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.660
This way!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.410
I smell something good...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.790
You really do have sharp instincts.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:10.510
W-W-What are these
nice-smelling tiny thingies?!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.470
They're the Galar Region's
famous scones-

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.730
Hey! Gimme some of these
nice-smelling tiny thingies!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.140
Open your ears.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.400
Delicious!

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:32.950
Pikachu, if you eat that fast, you'll-

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.040
You really are so alike...

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.000
Well, it was just so tasty...

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:50.010
And I have more,
ready for if I get hungry later!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:01.100
What?

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.030
A rock?

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.990
It came flying over here, didn't it?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.380
It's a Pokémon!
Gotta get the camera!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:24.840
Right.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.890
Ahh! My backpack!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:36.890
This one ran off, too!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.350
Were they working together?!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.560
After them!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:51.280
Hey, your ticket to the Wild Area
was in that backpack, wasn't it?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:51.990
Yeah!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.790
Err... Which way?!

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:10.760
It's a decoy?!

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.430
The backpack's that way!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:17.930
They're gone!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.350
Satoshi, you go that way!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.270
Right!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.870
Uhh... This way?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.630
A dead end?!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.510
Don't tell me...

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.260
I'm lost!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:03.020
Incoming call from Go.
Incoming call from Go.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.410
Go!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.830
Shh! Quietly!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.210
They're-

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.920
Wait! Let's see what
they're doing.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.810
Kusune! Fox Pokémon!
Evil type!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:48.980
Aided by the soft pads on its feet,
it silently raids the food stores of other Pokémon!

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.820
Hmm... Kusune, huh?

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:58.110
No data found for this Pokémon!

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:00.700
What?! Does that mean...

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.950
It's a new species of Pokémon?!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.710
Awesome!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.040
A new species! A new species!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.430
It looks like that one's the leader.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.640
Yeah.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.290
It really cares for its friends...

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:51.670
Aww... What a great guy!
It shared its food with them!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.630
Wait! Those are my tiny thingies!

00:10:57.710 --> 00:10:59.300
Oh, no! They heard us!

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.340
Gimme back my backpack!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:04.640
I said!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.390
Give it back!

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:24.990
Oh, no!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.620
Pikachu!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.090
Want a battle?
We'll take you on!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:41.510
Let's go, Pikachu!
Time to battle!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.180
Iron Tail!

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.270
I saw those earlier...!

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.200
Dodge it, Pikachu!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.080
Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.220
Now, Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.110
We did it, Pikachu!

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:50.200
Thanks!

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.500
You're a fun guy!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.550
Oww!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.890
You're not half bad.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.190
That was a nice kick earlier, too!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.980
Wait, are you...

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:26.360
Stop!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.040
Will you stop?!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.720
Pocket Monsters.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:57.430
.  Fire  .
Hibunny

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.660
You again, huh?

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.910
You've <i>got</i> to stop
causing trouble!

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.290
Hey! Hold on!

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:22.630
Sorry! That's my Pokémon!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.260
What? This one? It's yours?

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.930
Yes! I'll tell it off,
so it won't cause trouble again!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:34.930
So, please forgive it!
I'm really sorry!

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:47.070
Geez... Why did you lie like that?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.990
You knew I lied...

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.030
It was obvious.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:55.870
But even Hibunny was
surprised that you'd lie for it.

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.660
Hibunny?

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.620
That's its name?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.000
That's right.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.250
Hibunny, then...

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.750
Rotom.
Show me data on Hibunny.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.930
Hibunny! Rabbit Pokémon!
Fire type!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:16.010
Once it's raring to fight, the pads on the backs of its feet
and on its nose radiate tremendous heat!

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:19.890
Its legs are said to bring luck!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:25.080
It has a white body!
But that one's brown...

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.820
It covered itself in dirt.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.200
What? But why would it do that?

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.820
Those Kusune have lived in this city
for a long time.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:38.550
They shied away from others,
and how should I put it...

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:42.370
Well, they've always been
pretty hostile.

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.430
But then...

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:57.430
Hibunny arrived.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:16:01.270
It was brown,
having covered itself in dirt.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:05.730
I bet it was trying to
fit in with them.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:16.910
Who did that?!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:36.180
Somewhere along the line,
it pretty much became their leader.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.010
I see...

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:43.270
The Kusune haven't
gone hungry ever since.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.690
But still...

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.900
I realize they're just trying to live,

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:52.570
but they're still causing a nuisance.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.240
Could it be that...

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:05.500
...you've resigned yourselves
to living like this?

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:20.220
Don't give up!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.680
The world is a huge place!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.480
If you just want it bad enough,
you can go anywhere!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.980
Meet all sorts of people, too!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.730
So...

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.230
Go and give everything a try!

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:33.820
He's right, you know!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.910
Granted... he acts all smug about it,
but it's a new concept for him, too.

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.330
Hey! I've always thought that!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.410
You sure?

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.120
Yes, I am!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.750
Oh, also...

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.630
Apparently your legs bring luck!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.510
So if anything bad happens...

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.010
Just give it a good kick
with those strong legs!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:03.390
Don't say that!
What're you gonna do if it kicks you?!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.080
Oh, no!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.580
Satoshi! It's time for the train!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.630
Let's hurry!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.330
Thank you, mister!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.620
Thank you!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:21.890
Go! Hurry up!

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.140
Right!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:19.610
The leader of the Kusune...
it was a Hibunny?

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:22.570
Yeah! A really interesting one!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:28.790
And the Hibunny you met deliberately
covered itself in dirt to look like a Kusune?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:33.370
That might be why the
Smartphone Rotom didn't recognize it at first!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.330
I expect so.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:40.210
It was a very intriguing tale,
for sure.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.130
Thank you!

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:44.970
Next we're going to see
huge Pokémon in the Wild Area!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.050
Right. Take care of yourself.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:47.970
Yeah!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:57.160
I'm hungry... I was running around
chasing after those guys...

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:06.280
That's right... They ate them all...

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:11.040
The nice-smelling tiny thingies!
When did you get those?!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.160
That man gave me some.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.420
And I bought this milk tea!

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.040
You genius!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:21.130
Let's eat up!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:23.130
Yeah!

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:32.770
Go and Satoshi met Hibunny,
a tricky yet interesting Pokémon.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:37.940
Next time, more dreams and adventures
await in the world of Pocket Monsters!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.610
Let's go!

